=== Modifications ===
1. emulator.py:
   - Added set_keys(buttons: list[str]) abstractmethod + release_keys() abstractmethod to Emulator ABC
   - Implemented set_keys() for PyBoyEmulator (button_press per button, track _held_buttons)
   - Implemented release_keys() for PyBoyEmulator (button_release per held button)
   - Implemented set_keys() for PyGBAEmulator (auto-release compatible stub)
   - Implemented release_keys() for PyGBAEmulator (clear tracking)

2. server.py:
   - Added SafeTapRequest (press: str, dry_run: bool = False) Pydantic model
   - Added SafeStepRequest (dir: str, dry_run: bool = False) Pydantic model
   - Added POST /safe-tap endpoint: set_keys → tick 16 → release_keys → tick 2 → release_keys → tick 10 → read_state
   - Added POST /safe-step endpoint: set_keys → tick 16 → release_keys → tick 2 → release_keys → tick 10 → read_state
   - Both reject with 409 if keys already held before input
   - Both support dry_run=true (return planned sequence without executing)

